  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Countdown Begins-Street Child Cricket World Cup</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help us to raise funds for the upcoming street children cricket world cup , scheduled for September 2023 in Chennai India- organized by Street Child United. Salaam Baalak Trust is one of the 21 teams participating-  we have a mixed team of 8 boys and girls. To participate our children along with coach and staff need to travel from Delhi to Chennai which involves food, accommodation and transportation cost.Our Children are weaving a dream to win. WE NEED YOUR SUPPORT TO MAKE THIS DREAM COME TRUE!</narrative>
  </description>
